{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23568","headline":"西楼喜雪命宴 · 白居易","name":"西楼喜雪命宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿云黄惨澹，晓雪白飘颻。\n散麪遮槐市，堆花压柳桥。\n四郊铺缟素，万室甃琼瑶。\n银榼携桑落，金炉上丽谯。\n光迎舞妓动，寒近醉人销。\n歌乐虽盈耳，慙无五袴谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}